        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Vietnam, southern Vietnam, Ho Chi Minh City, Cambodia, Indochina Peninsula, Southeast Asia\n- Systems: National Route 13\n- Concepts: highways, national borders\n\nFacts:\n- National Route 13 is a highway in southern Vietnam.\n- National Route 13 stretches from the northeastern outskirts of Ho Chi Minh City toward the border with Cambodia.\n- Ho Chi Minh City is the commercial centre of Vietnam.\n- Cambodia is officially known as the Kingdom of Cambodia.\n- Cambodia is a country in the southern portion of the Indochina Peninsula in Southeast Asia.",
